    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Place a sapphire bead upon the map.</em></p><p>You may spend <strong>10 minutes</strong> in meditation within a Hex to <strong>anchor</strong> that Hex for the day.</p><ul><li>Until you finish a Soma Break, you have <strong>advantage</strong> on <strong>one</strong> attack roll, attribute check, or defense check made <strong>while inside that anchored Hex</strong>.</li><li>You choose which roll to apply it to after rolling but before the GM declares the result.</li></ul><p>You leave a dream-fingerprint in the landscape—small but protective.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"dwSapphireGate\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Gate Anchor</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> Once per Hex/day &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Downtime (10 min) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Meditate 10 min in a Hex to anchor it. Until your next Soma Break, reroll the lowest die on one attack/attribute/defense check made in that Hex — chosen after rolling but before the GM declares the result.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
